     "text_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<p>With support for up to 78 full-duplex transceivers capable of chip-to-chip communication at data rates of up to 25.78 Gbps, and backplane communication at speeds up to 12.5 Gbps, this high performance FPGA is also capable of accommodating up to 1,150K equivalent logic elements (LEs).</p><p style=\"margin-top:0\">&nbsp;</p>",
